# Local-only transcription implementation reference (do not commit)
TRANSCRIPTION_SERVICE.md

# Downloaded boundary sources for scripts/build_boundaries.py — 63 MB of published GeoJSON that the
# script re-fetches with --fetch. The GENERATED assets under frontend/public/boundaries and
# android/.../res/raw ARE committed; these inputs are not.
.boundary-cache/

# Transient git worktrees created for isolated parallel agents. Build state, never source.
.claude/worktrees/
